d":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Prerequisites\n\n- [x] I have searched existing issues and found no duplicate\n- [x] I have confirmed this feature is not already in the latest release\n\n### Problem or motivation\n\n大学很常见课程冲突的情况，有时候你喜欢的选修课与某个必修课重合了几节，教务系统没有阻止冲突选课，这样课表中就出现了同时要上两节课的情况。虽然作为学生不得不翘掉一节，但课表应该如实显示两节课而不是随机覆盖\n\n### Proposed solution\n\n网络视图本身比较挤，这种情况有点棘手。如果屏幕够大可以对半拆分成两块，小屏幕显示不下的话可能不得不通过手动配置的优先级覆盖了。\n\n### Alternatives considered\n\n还有一种思路是像wakeup一样带个角标，点一下切换，但不适用于现在点击显示详情的设计\n\n### Additional context\n\n<img width=\"1272\" height=\"2800\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e74a0e53-cb18-453f-aa4b-6989209059e1\" />\n\n<img width=\"1271\" height=\"727\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/caad2920-7852-4a77-9ccf-50c6f116b4b2\" />\n\n### Diagnostic info (auto-filled by app)\n\n```markdown\n\n```","closed_by":{"login":"jim139129","id":217778400,"node_id":"U_kgDODPsI4A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217778400?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129","html_url":"https://github.com/jim139129","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jim139129/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lingion/sleepy/issues/10